  "_comment": "security_headers, risky_methods, rate_limit_headers and mime_signatures are the original sections (extended). info_disclosure_headers, cookie_flags, tls_checks, cors_probe, host_header_probe and redirect_checks are NEW sections and need scanner support. mime_signatures are offset-0 magic bytes only (formats whose magic is at an offset, like MP4 'ftyp' at 4 or tar 'ustar' at 257, cannot be matched by prefix). required_security_headers (webspy addition) is the subset of security_headers get_security reports as missing; other security_headers are listed only when present.",
